| Field       | Type           | Null | Key | Default | Extra |
+-------------+----------------+------+-----+---------+-------+
| sku         | varbinary(128) | NO   | PRI | NULL    |       |
| keyspace_id | varbinary(128) | YES  |     | NULL    |       |
+-------------+----------------+------+-----+---------+-------+
2 rows in set (0.01 sec)

mysql> select sku, hex(keyspace_id) from corder_lookup;
